<p><a name="fn6"></a>6. 10,000 Small Businesses Voices, "<a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/SECRS/2023/December/20231229/R-1813/R-1813_112123_156602_328107635870_1.pdf">Comments on Regulatory Capital Rule: Large Banking Organizations and Banking Organizations with Significant Trading Activity (PDF)</a>" (November 21, 2023). <a href="#f6">Return to text</a></p>

<p><a name="fn7"></a>7. See Randal K. Quarles, "<a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/speech/quarles20211202a.htm">Between the Hither and the Farther Shore: Thoughts on Unfinished Business</a>" (speech at the American Enterprise Institute, Washington, D.C., December 2, 2021), ("A major issue that we are grappling with is how to implement these [Basel III endgame capital] reforms, which reduce the role of bank internal models on bank capital requirements, <em>while maintaining the overall level of aggregate capital requirements</em>.") (emphasis added). <a href="#f7">Return to text</a></p>

